<title>USA: Conseco senior debt raised to triple-B-plus.</title>
<headline>Conseco senior debt raised to triple-B-plus.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Friday it has upgraded the senior debt of financial services and insurance company Conseco Inc to triple-B-plus from triple-B.  </p>
<p>The rating was also withdrawn from rating watch, where it was placed to reflect Conseco's announcement last week that it completed its merger with Pioneer Financial Services, Duff &amp; Phelp's said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
